      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPTON EXPRESS (2) recorded a 3.5 lengths win (23.11) in a TG1-4W last time at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. CINTA'S GOLD (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has hit the frame at her last three runs, the latest finishing third (23.37) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. BUSY EARNIN' (8) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten 3.5 lengths (22.48) at Murray Bridge in a Grade 6 over 395m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Bold showing expected. COME ON LUBA (4) comes into calculations after placing most recently.",
